{"case_id":"kq-013","case_sha256":"73c4792d09e4d3ae384ae90497d470e669bcf6a41b65d5c7923fe22b5991fe50","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05","cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"教务处教材建设科负责教材管理、选用审核以及征订和发放。该科所在地点：办公楼106室、6B107-2；电话：028-84078905、028-84079924。这些信息来自官网科室设置摘要，实际办事前建议先拨打电话确认在办时间和校区。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5116.251200000079,"cost_usd":0.002356632,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-014","case_sha256":"2a8013001470c0e1a25715556bcfb1958dea6211a0755e285ad3906692fcd5dd","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:30","cdut:candidate-office:04","cdut:chunk:xscoffices:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:candidate-office:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"由教务处实践教学科负责，职责包括毕业设计（论文）、实验项目及大学生竞赛等。资料记载地点为办公楼107室，公开电话028-84078931；其中地点和电话来自官网检索摘要，建议前往前先核对，该来源未注明适用校区。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4485.397800000101,"cost_usd":0.00120957,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-015","case_sha256":"58789ffd07880c2dbc1a19ebe49dd0edc5c85c96eb4f14101e2f79df5ee6d620","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04","cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"由教务处质量建设与智慧教学科承担，职责包括本科培养方案、专业建设和课程建设等。官网所列地点为办公楼105室，电话028-84078883；该来源尚未确认适用哪个校区，因此地点和电话请以教务处最新信息为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4248.662500000137,"cost_usd":0.00117741,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-016","case_sha256":"2bdee8918a255b71dd05376b5ba301f78404a3af9e8134563d470339a0fa5792","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"校医院简介将其列为“校内非营利性公立医院、大学生医保首诊医院”（见2026年新生入学须知，该说明适用于本科生）。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4344.290900000033,"cost_usd":0.00230919,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-017","case_sha256":"419c32a93e839a0aaca74a52f1d7811e2d78859e93f475ece20fbb90ad9a38b8","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview","cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"设有。成都理工大学医院设有口腔科（含口腔诊疗中心）和检验科。口腔科还提供工作日午间及周末延时服务，具体以校医院当日安排为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4623.517699999866,"cost_usd":0.0023859,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-018","case_sha256":"c6549e2e0796511fca4c4032f49e89993d5b137df694195cd3f42f921c6a1691","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-canteen:01","cdut:chunk:expand-schedule:02","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:14"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"包含。医院简介的放射科项目中明确列出了CT检查，同时还有全身各部位数字化摄影DR检查和口腔全景牙摄影DR检查；上述项目统计截至2026年2月，来源适用校区尚未确认。建议到院前向放射科确认具体检查部位与安排。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4528.275900000153,"cost_usd":0.001398414,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-019","case_sha256":"04da193cfdc0c731ce4a79b6eccfa8da7dd26b7d32d243edf72a8a69d1dd7c53","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistwork2025:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"校医院检验科与第三方检测机构长期合作，对院内不能自行开展的实验室检测项目，采用标本外送检测方式处理。该概况资料来源的适用校区尚未确认，送检流程和报告领取时间建议就诊时向检验科确认。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4109.860699999899,"cost_usd":0.001625526,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
