{"case_id":"kq-032","case_sha256":"b1a68277ded2f35aed161eed0f51ee3ef7c40b03f8f8b2db16c4419060f8ecb1","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"按2026—2027学年第一学期选课通知，跨年级、跨专业选课属于第2轮“非计划课阶段”，时间为2026年7月9日13:00—9月14日18:00；该轮现已结束，且该通知可能已过期，请以教务处最新通知为准。该通知未注明适用校区。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":6356.538600000022,"cost_usd":0.002633454,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-033","case_sha256":"8b90f0c47da6d90f870faf2e381ee3f2af9242ae28c478002ea95e508877e82b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04","cdut:chunk:expand-cet:01","cdut:chunk:cet2026h1:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027","cdut:source:xjgl2019"],"answer":"不需要。按学校选课通知，本学期用大学英语四、六级成绩替代大学英语课程的，无需再选相应课程。替代须符合学籍管理办法第十七条：非英语专业、开课时止两年内成绩折百分制四级≥75分或六级≥65分，并填写《课程替代及免修申请表》，经学院审批后报教务处备案。上述选课通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5408.427599999868,"cost_usd":0.001887672,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-034","case_sha256":"90d50a17eca9edb647aec9f0feb547532570b3e2f48eb226b2a1c801956a61ac","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"根据教务处2026年6月26日通知，2026—2027学年第一学期两轮选课均于2026年9月14日18:00结束，通知明确“选课结束后，一律不能补、退选课程”。该通知未注明适用校区，且可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5093.949900000098,"cost_usd":0.001754022,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-035","case_sha256":"abefc8df6aa3e46d3506f8939f4509fc11be9aeb1bfb46b641b2b42808e28715","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:candidate-office:05","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:11"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不允许。教务处《关于2026-2027学年第一学期选课的通知》明确：选课只能在学校教务系统操作，严禁使用第三方抢课软件、脚本外挂；一经查实，会取消本次所有选课结果并按校规处理，相关损失自行承担。该通知发布于2026年6月26日，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；通知未注明适用校区。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":3534.362500000043,"cost_usd":0.001201236,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-036","case_sha256":"dba729cf02a3cd3366a52891a8196a54b30837351272e30ff59a996b4c1d210d","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:07","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026","cdut:source:wx:fresh2026fee"],"answer":"不能直接套用。宜宾校区学生按属地原则参加宜宾市城乡居民基本医疗保险，参保缴费标准和医保待遇均按宜宾市当地政策执行，具体见宜宾校区官网通知；成都校区的2026年标准仅适用于在成都参保的学生（相关资料可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。建议直接查阅宜宾校区官网的最新参保通知。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5400.669099999959,"cost_usd":0.002139582,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-037","case_sha256":"b876b18a54c3c009989a65627e37d37e55811ba2ee30cd3595ef239fbc680003","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026","cdut:source:wx:fee20262027"],"answer":"不是。助学贷款不代缴医保：办理助学贷款的学生如要参加2026年成都大学生医保，仍需自行按学校财务处公布的缴费方式缴费（该资料可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。2026年集中参保缴费已于2025年12月20日左右截止；现在补办需由学院统一登记后，经校医院医保办办理，自缴费之日起90天后才享受待遇。来源对适用校区尚未确认，宜宾校区学生按当地政策执行。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":7523.15950000002,"cost_usd":0.003106278,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-038","case_sha256":"c5073194f0bb310c774eb38957d58643bcdfcbc4f135750d4276ecfb3f52afd9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"通知要求先由**学院**统一收集延迟毕业或休学学生的姓名、学号及缴费金额，再将盖章的纸质版交至财务处信息管理中心俞老师生成费用信息，之后学生按财务处公布的缴费方式缴费。该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；宜宾校区的缴费标准和医保待遇按宜宾市当地政策执行。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5350.408799999968,"cost_usd":0.002768892,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-039","case_sha256":"47ea4c9ed26aca7bd0b6f81d2c1816e1c4abf95f39e21f044352365b58c5c5c2","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是立即享受。2026年集中参保期外补办的成都校区学生，完成参保登记并缴费后，自缴费之日起90天后（不含第90天）才可享受大学生医保待遇；宜宾校区按宜宾市当地政策执行。该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5104.203200000029,"cost_usd":0.002371284,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-040","case_sha256":"31493bad653f296e2b379f5b64bf28cf7860d32b7803e87843f17142e9f6105a","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:09","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:09","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是。2026年大病医疗互助补充保险需在基本医保之外单独缴费，属自愿购买险种，不包含在基本医疗保险内；只有先购买了大学生基本医疗保险，才能购买该补充保险。该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；宜宾校区按当地政策执行。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4222.380900000189,"cost_usd":0.002200896,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
