{"case_id":"kq-055","case_sha256":"f8b5cde63e4cfa826acaa0d737a6dfd7dd012498baf6b73f17591c659aab7867","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:40","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:identity2021:01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:35"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:40","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:identity2021:01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:35"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:identity2021","cdut:source:portal-home"],"answer":"不能。寒假值班表只能反映当时假期谁值班，既不能说明统一身份认证是否升级，也不能代表现在的系统状态；本次资料里也没有统一身份认证的升级公告。现有资料只涉及账号激活、安全手机更换和密码找回，升级进度与完成时间仍无法确认。建议直接向网络与信息化处核实，手册上的电话是028-84079530，拨打前请核对最新联系方式。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4753.5023000000365,"cost_usd":0.002096352,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
