{"case_id":"kq-057","case_sha256":"c63a415f111b42459f81bec69fb2a56003cbfb29becabc7e2048f6d65374ec3f","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1165:guide-body","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1165:guide-body","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"没有给出。该通知正文只说明按《机电工程学院2026届毕业生文明离校日程安排表》执行，各项手续的具体日期都放在附件里，正文没有逐项列出；正文另外写明，遇到问题请联系带班辅导员。这份通知发布于2026年5月26日，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5060.6135999996695,"cost_usd":0.00276546,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-058","case_sha256":"8cd4dfecb68cdef63c99440ac6279d4d7177223926f41fc4686995c72f923112","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"机电学院通知要求：毕业生办理离校手续如遇问题，请及时与**带班辅导员**联系。该通知针对2026届毕业生，发布于2026年5月，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":4913.220699999783,"cost_usd":0.001728438,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
