{"case_id":"kq-076","case_sha256":"deef5fe59602111d83bf6008d99be00c893c161292aa4f8c1166f97812f6fb59","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"这是原图用字留下的问题，不是流程差异：图片中的“保修”是按原图照录保留的，正文事项名是“报修”，正式名称应以“报修”为准（砚湖易办办事指南中列出的也是“网络故障报修”）。办理流程本身一致：登录砚湖易办→事务中心→选择网络与信息化处→填写表单提交审批→通过后维修。该流程适用于本科生、研究生，来源适用校区尚未确认。按“网络故障报修”名称在砚湖易办办事指南中查找即可。","behavior":null,"latency_ms":5319.175900000118,"cost_usd":0.00257544,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
